msgstr "避免仅从文档版式或来源措辞推断执行、身份、形式真理或核验成功。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/formalKindExample|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve source identity and exact-statement attribution; keep unresolved or missing information explicit without invented defaults."
msgstr "保留来源身份与确切陈述归属；明确未解析或缺失的信息，而不虚构默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/formalKindExample|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this source meaning: ex:block gmeow:formalKind gmeow:formalKindExample ."
msgstr "保留此来源含义：ex:block gmeow:formalKind gmeow:formalKindExample ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/formalKindExercise|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "exercise"
msgstr "练习"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/formalKindExercise|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A source-designated task for the reader. Its presence does not assert an attempted or completed solution."
msgstr "来源为读者指定的任务。其存在不断言已尝试或完成解答。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/formalKindExercise|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this explicit part of the source structure or apparatus with its original evidence."
msgstr "用于保留来源结构或论述装置的此明确部分及其原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/formalKindExercise|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring execution, identity, formal truth or successful verification from document layout or source wording alone."
msgstr "避免仅从文档版式或来源措辞推断执行、身份、形式真理或核验成功。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/formalKindExercise|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve source identity and exact-statement attribution; keep unresolved or missing information explicit without invented defaults."
msgstr "保留来源身份与确切陈述归属；明确未解析或缺失的信息，而不虚构默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/formalKindExercise|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this source meaning: ex:block gmeow:formalKind gmeow:formalKindExercise ."
msgstr "保留此来源含义：ex:block gmeow:formalKind gmeow:formalKindExercise ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/formalKindSolution|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "solution"
msgstr "解答"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/formalKindSolution|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A unit the source presents as an answer to a task, without certifying correctness or inventing a missing task link."
msgstr "来源呈现为任务答案的单元，不证明其正确性，也不虚构缺失的任务链接。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/formalKindSolution|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this explicit part of the source structure or apparatus with its original evidence."
msgstr "用于保留来源结构或论述装置的此明确部分及其原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/formalKindSolution|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring execution, identity, formal truth or successful verification from document layout or source wording alone."
msgstr "避免仅从文档版式或来源措辞推断执行、身份、形式真理或核验成功。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/formalKindSolution|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve source identity and exact-statement attribution; keep unresolved or missing information explicit without invented defaults."
msgstr "保留来源身份与确切陈述归属；明确未解析或缺失的信息，而不虚构默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/formalKindSolution|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this source meaning: ex:block gmeow:formalKind gmeow:formalKindSolution ."
msgstr "保留此来源含义：ex:block gmeow:formalKind gmeow:formalKindSolution ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/formalKindNote|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "note"
msgstr "注记"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/formalKindNote|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A source-designated explanatory or supplementary formal note, distinct from a proof or theorem status."
msgstr "来源指定的解释性或补充性形式注记，区别于证明或定理状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/formalKindNote|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this explicit part of the source structure or apparatus with its original evidence."
msgstr "用于保留来源结构或论述装置的此明确部分及其原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/formalKindNote|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring execution, identity, formal truth or successful verification from document layout or source wording alone."
msgstr "避免仅从文档版式或来源措辞推断执行、身份、形式真理或核验成功。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/formalKindNote|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve source identity and exact-statement attribution; keep unresolved or missing information explicit without invented defaults."
msgstr "保留来源身份与确切陈述归属；明确未解析或缺失的信息，而不虚构默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/formalKindNote|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this source meaning: ex:block gmeow:formalKind gmeow:formalKindNote ."
msgstr "保留此来源含义：ex:block gmeow:formalKind gmeow:formalKindNote ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TableCellTableKindConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "documentary cell table scope"
msgstr "文档单元格表格范围"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TableCellTableKindConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A documentary cell belongs to a block explicitly classified as a table. The link does not classify either resource as a mathematical matrix."
msgstr "文档单元格属于明确分类为表格的块。此链接不将任何一方分类为数学矩阵。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TableCellTableKindConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency of the supplied source inventory."
msgstr "用于检查所给来源清单的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TableCellTableKindConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this obligation executes a producer, parser, proof checker or table renderer."
msgstr "避免声称此义务执行生产器、解析器、证明检查器或表格呈现器。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TableCellTableKindConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the exact source evidence when a supplied structure violates the obligation; never repair it with invented defaults."
msgstr "当所给结构违反义务时保留确切来源证据；绝不使用虚构默认值修复它。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TableCellTableKindConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:TableCellTableKindConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:cellOf ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:TableCellTableKindConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:cellOf ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TableCellIndexOriginConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "documentary cell index origin"
msgstr "文档单元格索引起点"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TableCellIndexOriginConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Each supplied cell coordinate pair has its table's explicit index origin, and neither coordinate precedes that origin. The source indices are not silently rebased."
msgstr "每个给出的单元格坐标对均具有其表格的明确索引起点，且任一坐标不早于该起点。不悄然改变来源索引的起点。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TableCellIndexOriginConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency of the supplied source inventory."
msgstr "用于检查所给来源清单的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TableCellIndexOriginConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this obligation executes a producer, parser, proof checker or table renderer."
msgstr "避免声称此义务执行生产器、解析器、证明检查器或表格呈现器。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TableCellIndexOriginConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the exact source evidence when a supplied structure violates the obligation; never repair it with invented defaults."
msgstr "当所给结构违反义务时保留确切来源证据；绝不使用虚构默认值修复它。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TableCellIndexOriginConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:TableCellIndexOriginConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:cellOf ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:TableCellIndexOriginConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:cellOf ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TableCellCoordinateUniquenessConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "documentary table coordinate uniqueness"
msgstr "文档表格坐标唯一性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TableCellCoordinateUniquenessConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Within one source table, a row and column pair identifies one documentary cell. The same coordinates in another table remain a different scope."
msgstr "在同一来源表格内，一个行列对标识一个文档单元格。另一表格中的相同坐标保持属于不同范围。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TableCellCoordinateUniquenessConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency of the supplied source inventory."
msgstr "用于检查所给来源清单的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TableCellCoordinateUniquenessConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this obligation executes a producer, parser, proof checker or table renderer."
msgstr "避免声称此义务执行生产器、解析器、证明检查器或表格呈现器。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TableCellCoordinateUniquenessConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the exact source evidence when a supplied structure violates the obligation; never repair it with invented defaults."
msgstr "当所给结构违反义务时保留确切来源证据；绝不使用虚构默认值修复它。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TableCellCoordinateUniquenessConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:TableCellCoordinateUniquenessConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:cell ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:TableCellCoordinateUniquenessConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:cell ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FormalBlockKindPresentConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "printed formal block kind presence"
msgstr "印刷形式块种类存在性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FormalBlockKindPresentConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A block classified as formal exposition retains at least one source-attributed printed formal kind. The vocabulary remains open and the kind establishes no theorem or proof status."
msgstr "分类为形式论述的块保留至少一个来源归属的印刷形式种类。词汇保持开放，该种类不确立定理或证明状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FormalBlockKindPresentConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency of the supplied source inventory."
msgstr "用于检查所给来源清单的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FormalBlockKindPresentConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this obligation executes a producer, parser, proof checker or table renderer."
msgstr "避免声称此义务执行生产器、解析器、证明检查器或表格呈现器。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FormalBlockKindPresentConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the exact source evidence when a supplied structure violates the obligation; never repair it with invented defaults."
msgstr "当所给结构违反义务时保留确切来源证据；绝不使用虚构默认值修复它。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FormalBlockKindPresentConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:FormalBlockKindPresentConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:formalKind ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:FormalBlockKindPresentConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:formalKind ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/EquationSourceSurfaceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "equation source surface retention"
msgstr "公式来源表面形式保留"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/EquationSourceSurfaceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every supplied equation-source string has a retained language surface carrying that exact text. Retention does not parse the string or certify mathematical meaning."
msgstr "每个给出的公式来源字符串均具有承载该确切文本的保留语言表面形式。保留不解析字符串，也不证明数学意义。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/EquationSourceSurfaceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency of the supplied source inventory."
msgstr "用于检查所给来源清单的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/EquationSourceSurfaceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this obligation executes a producer, parser, proof checker or table renderer."
msgstr "避免声称此义务执行生产器、解析器、证明检查器或表格呈现器。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/EquationSourceSurfaceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the exact source evidence when a supplied structure violates the obligation; never repair it with invented defaults."
msgstr "当所给结构违反义务时保留确切来源证据；绝不使用虚构默认值修复它。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/EquationSourceSurfaceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:EquationSourceSurfaceConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:equationSource ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:EquationSourceSurfaceConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:equationSource ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BlockRenderingSurfaceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "block rendering form retention"
msgstr "块呈现形式保留"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BlockRenderingSurfaceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every supplied block rendering names its actual content and a form retained as a block surface. Content keeps its own sort; a documentary block is not converted into an expression, statement or proof."
msgstr "每个给出的块呈现命名其实际内容及作为块表面形式保留的形式。内容保持自身类别；文档块不被转换为表达式、陈述或证明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BlockRenderingSurfaceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency of the supplied source inventory."
msgstr "用于检查所给来源清单的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BlockRenderingSurfaceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this obligation executes a producer, parser, proof checker or table renderer."
msgstr "避免声称此义务执行生产器、解析器、证明检查器或表格呈现器。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BlockRenderingSurfaceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the exact source evidence when a supplied structure violates the obligation; never repair it with invented defaults."
msgstr "当所给结构违反义务时保留确切来源证据；绝不使用虚构默认值修复它。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BlockRenderingSurfaceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:BlockRenderingSurfaceConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:blockRendering ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:BlockRenderingSurfaceConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:blockRendering ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/reference-apparatus|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reference apparatus"
msgstr "参考文献论述装置"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/reference-apparatus|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Source-preserving technical apparatus for reference-work blocks, documentary table cells and explicit language and mathematical renderings."
msgstr "为参考作品块、文档表格单元格以及明确的语言和数学呈现保留来源的技术论述装置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/reference-apparatus|http://purl.org/dc/terms/title"
msgid "GMEOW Reference Apparatus Module"
msgstr "GMEOW 参考论述装置模块"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/reference-apparatus|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/sliceConsumer"
msgid "Katamari reference-work import and other attributed document consumers retaining source apparatus without fabricated parsing, execution or proof certification."
msgstr "Katamari 参考作品导入及其他保留来源论述装置、而不虚构解析、执行或证明认证的有归属文档使用方。"

# Structural-caption mapping instance owned by reference apparatus.

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mapSchemaStructuralCaption|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "structural caption to schema description"
msgstr "结构说明文字到 schema 描述"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mapSchemaStructuralCaption|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The schema profile retains a structural segment's caption as a description, with an explicit loss of its caption role rather than media-file classification."
msgstr "schema 配置将结构片段的说明文字保留为描述，明确丢失其说明文字角色，而非将片段分类为媒体文件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mapSchemaStructuralCaption|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when a structural content caption must survive the schema profile."
msgstr "用于结构内容说明文字必须在 schema 配置中保留的情况。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mapSchemaStructuralCaption|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid projecting a structural caption as evidence that its bearer is a MediaObject."
msgstr "避免将结构说明文字投影为其承载者是 MediaObject 的证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mapSchemaStructuralCaption|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the original GMEOW caption and its structural subject; disclose the role lost in the description view."
msgstr "保留原始 GMEOW 说明文字及其结构主体；披露描述视图中丢失的角色。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mapSchemaStructuralCaption|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A structural caption remains documentary: ex:figure gmeow:caption \"A bridge plan.\"@en ."
msgstr "结构说明文字保持文档性质：ex:figure gmeow:caption \"A bridge plan.\"@en ."
